config:
  theme: default
  themeCSS: |
    text[y="-25"] {
      font-size: 28px !important;
      font-weight: 700 !important;
      text-anchor: middle !important;
    }
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor User
    participant Browser as Next.js Client<br/>(Browser)
    participant Dexie as Local Persistence<br/>(Dexie / IndexedDB)
    participant Supabase as Supabase<br/>(Auth / Postgres)

    Note over User,Browser: Trigger: Signed-in user changes<br/>or deletes a portfolio
    Note over Browser,Supabase: Applies after the user is authenticated<br/>and initial synchronization is complete

    alt User creates, renames, or edits a portfolio
        User->>Browser: Change portfolio data
        Browser->>Dexie: Save local copy
        Dexie-->>Browser: Local save acknowledged
        Browser->>Supabase: Upsert cloud copy
        Supabase-->>Browser: Cloud save acknowledged
        Browser-->>User: Show Saved and sync status
    else User deletes a portfolio
        User->>Browser: Confirm deletion
        Browser->>Dexie: Delete local copy
        Dexie-->>Browser: Local deletion acknowledged
        Browser->>Supabase: Delete cloud copy
        Supabase-->>Browser: Cloud deletion acknowledged
        Browser-->>User: Remove portfolio from the interface
    end

    Note over Browser,Dexie: Quotes and analysis responses remain local
    Note over Browser,Supabase: Only saved portfolios synchronize to Supabase
    Note over Browser: Market-data and analysis API flows are the same as guest mode
